  - $d_{C6} = 144$
- Supplier fixed costs $f_i$:
  - $f_{S1} = 98.88$
  - $f_{S2} = 99.73$
  - $f_{S3} = 94.01$
  - $f_{S4} = 93.77$
  - $f_{S5} = 107.59$
  - $f_{S6} = 112.65$
- Transportation costs $c_{ij}$ (per unit from supplier $i$ to store $j$):

|        | C1      | C2      | C3      | C4      | C5      | C6      |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|
| S1     | 0.08    | 52.33   | 73.57   | 1237.33 | 0.07    | 112.16  |
| S2     | 46.02   | 175.23  | 2026.83 | 299.89  | 966.53  | 1590.42 |
